<title>USA: Fed says 2-day fixed system RPs totaled $3.691 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says 2-day fixed system RPs totaled $3.691 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added $3.691 billion to the banking system Tuesday via a round of two-day fixed system repurchase agreements, a spokeswoman at the New York Fed said.</p>
<p>((--N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660 ))</p>
